  "description": "Next-generation MySQL 9.7 LTS & phpMyAdmin Pro SQL Workbench — built-in AI VECTOR(N) SQL, live MySQL/Cloud SSL connections, Visual Query Builder, Data Profiler, Draggable ER Designer, Instant REST API & ORM Codegen, and 12 EKONI themes.",
